    ["Zawadi sees a minim in the pattern. Which name does she say?", "Taa-aa", [...w("M_RH_NAME_TAA_AA_SHORT", "Taa"), ...w("M_RH_NAME_TATE_ONE", "Ta-te"), ...w("M_RH_REST_SOUNDED", "Sh")], "Taa-aa is the minim."]
