    c("A learner says the flame symbol on a bottle means the liquid is good for lighting a fire. What is wrong with that?", "The symbol warns that it catches fire easily", "A hazard symbol warns. It is not a use.", ["M_HS_FLAME_FIRE", "Nothing, the liquid is for lighting fires", "It means the liquid is safe near a stove"], ["M_HS_SKULL_DEAD", "It means the liquid is poisonous"]),
    c("Baraka sees a symbol of three blades on a container. What should he do?", "Tell the teacher and keep away", "The three-blade symbol warns of radioactive material. Tell an adult.", ["M_HS_FLAME_FIRE", "Use it to light a fire", "Open it to see what is inside"], ["M_HS_SKULL_DEAD", "Smell it quickly"])
