    ["Which of these is a use of light?", "Solar panels turn sunlight into electricity", [...m2("M_LU_ONLY_SEE", "Light is used only for seeing"), ...m2("M_LU_PLANT_SOIL_FOOD", "Light has no use for plants"), ...m2("M_LU_EYES_SEND", "Light comes out of our eyes to heat the panel")], "Solar panels use light from the Sun to make electricity."]
