    c2("Achieng looks at the thin blue lines on the inside of her wrist. What are they?", "Veins, a kind of blood vessel", "Veins are blood vessels that carry blood back to the heart.", ["M_CP_VESSEL_NAMES", "Nerves", "Strings that hold the hand together"], ["M_CP_LUNGS_IN", "Parts of the stomach"]),
    c2("A learner colours the heart, vessels and blood red on a body picture. Which organ should she NOT colour red?", "The stomach", "The stomach is part of the digestive system.", ["M_CP_LUNGS_IN", "The heart", "The blood vessels"], ["M_CP_HEART_PRODUCES", "The blood"]),
    c2("Njoroge says the heart makes blood. What is true?", "The heart pumps blood, which is made in the bones", "The heart moves blood. It does not make it.", ["M_CP_HEART_PRODUCES", "He is right, the heart makes all the blood", "The heart stores all the blood"], ["M_CP_LUNGS_IN", "The lungs make blood"]),
    c2("A child cuts her finger and sees red liquid. What is it?", "Blood, part of the circulatory system", "Blood carries food and oxygen round the body.", ["M_CP_VESSEL_NAMES", "Water from the nerves", "Juice from the bones"], ["M_CP_LUNGS_IN", "Liquid that comes from the stomach"])
