    Q4("Which document in Kenya protects our rights?", "The Constitution and its Bill of Rights", w3("HR_ONLY_POLICE", "The price list of the local market", "The timetable of the school week", "The weather report for the week"), "The Bill of Rights is in the Constitution."),
    Q4("What should a learner do if a classmate's rights are abused?", "Report to a teacher or an adult who can help", w3("HR_ONLY_POLICE", "Hide away and say nothing to anyone", "Keep quiet and walk away from the abuse", "Join in and laugh at the abuse as well"), "Reporting abuse helps protect rights.")
